{"id":"n66405-1-17","stage":5,"title":"안목 · 眼力","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66405-1-17-1","ko":"이런 낙서가 무슨 미술 작품이야?","zh":"这种乱涂乱画的算什么艺术作品啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이런","meaning":"这样的","explanation":"이런：这样的","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17869","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"낙서가","meaning":"乱涂乱画，涂鸦","explanation":"낙서：乱涂乱画，涂鸦；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"낙서","audio":"/audio/d13a4846a0fb973824e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36842","senseId":"1","lemma":"낙서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미술","meaning":"美术","explanation":"미술：美术","readings":[{"term":"미술","audio":"/audio/e5f3334a3919e9e30fb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28771","senseId":"1","lemma":"미술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작품이야?","meaning":"作品","explanation":"작품：作品；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"작품","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24837","senseId":"2","lemma":"작품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"这样的","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"17869","definition":"状态、样子、性质等这样的。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"d13a4846a0fb9738","term":"낙서","zh":"乱涂乱画，涂鸦","audio":"/audio/d13a4846a0fb973824e4.mp3","entryId":"36842","definition":"作为玩乐随随便便地随地乱写或乱画；或指这样的字或画。","pronunciation":["낙써"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"e5f3334a3919e9e3","term":"미술","zh":"美术","audio":"/audio/e5f3334a3919e9e30fb0.mp3","entryId":"28771","definition":"绘画或雕刻等表现视觉美的艺术。","pronunciation":["미ː술"]},{"id":"eec1d8d2d561e94f","term":"작품","zh":"作品","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3","entryId":"24837","definition":"画、雕刻、小说、诗等通过艺术创作活动制成的东西。","pronunciation":["작품"]}],"audio":"/audio/ce2f22678374eec8d8fd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66405-1-17-2","ko":"너는 그림에 대한 안목을 좀 길러야겠다.","zh":"你得培养一下对画作的鉴赏力了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그림에","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대한","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안목을","meaning":"眼力，眼光","explanation":"안목：眼力，眼光；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"안목","audio":"/audio/f786934dec3ca5be2994.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66405","senseId":"1","lemma":"안목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길러야겠다.","meaning":"培养，积蓄，增强","explanation":"기르다：培养，积蓄，增强；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"기르다","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62242","senseId":"4","lemma":"기르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","term":"대하다","zh":"对，对于","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3","entryId":"86300","definition":"当作对象或对方。","pronunciation":["대ː하다"]},{"id":"f786934dec3ca5be","term":"안목","zh":"眼力，眼光","audio":"/audio/f786934dec3ca5be2994.mp3","entryId":"66405","definition":"能判断或区别某东西的价值的能力。","pronunciation":["안ː목"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"8b121394eb596253","term":"기르다","zh":"培养，积蓄，增强","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3","entryId":"62242","definition":"使肉体或精神上的能力更为强大。","pronunciation":["기르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/98bdac7cec48cb1d2762.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.491,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66405","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3177,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你得培养一下对画作的鉴赏力了。","听说有人拥有预言的天赋呢。我们也去看看吧。","这种乱涂乱画的算什么艺术作品啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你得培养一下对画作的鉴赏力了。","这种乱涂乱画的算什么艺术作品啊？","听说有人拥有预言的天赋呢。我们也去看看吧。"],"answer":0}]}
